teristics of the Vtuber\nShe is about 16-18 years old with long, light gray hair.\n　She wears her hair in a high half-twin, and the half-twin is short. She has a bun.\n\n(2) She has emerald eyes and drooping eyes. We would be happy if you could make her eyes sparkle.\n\n(3) She has a bright, gentle, and somewhat outgoing impression.\n\n(4) The costume is what she is wearing, and we can omit or alter it as we wish.\n　We would like her breasts to have a strong impact.\n\nFile format\nWe would be happy if the file is in PNG format with transparency.\n\n\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1idpEjyKtvomTB0FWE3FtbYPD-vgiBw9t?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@haruno_1112/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2262287, "client_id": 2796720, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bbf4f380/uploads/origins/f2db00e5-6891-4296-9397-6ccd028d350f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e13aea476dfa82969bfd6227c2491ef1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bbf4f380/uploads/origins/f2db00e5-6891-4296-9397-6ccd028d350f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e13aea476dfa82969bfd6227c2491ef1, https://si.imgix.net/bbf4f380/uploads/origins/f2db00e5-6891-4296-9397-6ccd028d350f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9eda4012e4d1970601c255b40ba0369 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bbf4f380/uploads/origins/f2db00e5-6891-4296-9397-6ccd028d350f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8970f039a66e28ddcc568070a3b51cdb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bbf4f380/uploads/origins/f2db00e5-6891-4296-9397-6ccd028d350f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cro